      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of cosmic insignificance, which is a very human reaction to the vastness of the universe. Many philosophers and thinkers have wrestled with this feeling, often finding meaning in the very act of observing and experiencing existence. While the universe is immense, the richness of human connection, art, and personal experience provides a powerful anchor to our lives. Perhaps finding beauty in those small moments, like the images you saw, can offer a counterpoint to the overwhelming emptiness.",
      "source": "target",
